# Bicycle Sales Analysis: Interactive Customer Insights Dashboard

An interactive Microsoft Excel dashboard that shows which customer characteristics influence bicycle purchases. Built with pivot tables, charts and slicers.

![Bike Sales Dashboard](images/bicycle-dashboard.png)

## Project Objective

Find the demographic factors that affect whether a customer buys a bicycle, so a business can target its marketing and stock more effectively.

**Primary KPIs**
- Gender vs. purchase
- Average income vs. purchase
- Age bracket vs. purchase
- Commute distance vs. purchase

**Secondary KPIs (used as slicers):** Marital Status, Region, Education

